# ⚡ COMPETITIVE EFFICIENCY RULES (MANDATORY)

---

## 🎯 PRIME DIRECTIVE

> Find the MOST EFFICIENT solution, not just A solution.
> Think like a competitive programmer: Time complexity MATTERS.

---

## 1️⃣ COMPLEXITY ANALYSIS (MANDATORY)

Before writing ANY algorithm, you MUST:
1. State the time complexity: O(?)
2. State the space complexity: O(?)
3. Justify why this is optimal

❌ Forbidden:
```python
# Just writing code without analysis
def find_duplicates(items):
    duplicates = []
    for i in items:
        if items.count(i) > 1 and i not in duplicates:
            duplicates.append(i)
    return duplicates
```

✅ Required:
```python
# Time: O(n), Space: O(n)
# Optimal because we need to see each element at least once
def find_duplicates(items: list[T]) -> list[T]:
    seen: set[T] = set()
    duplicates: set[T] = set()
    for item in items:
        if item in seen:
            duplicates.add(item)
        seen.add(item)
    return list(duplicates)
```

