## 2️⃣ DATA STRUCTURE SELECTION

### Choose the RIGHT data structure:

| Operation | Best Structure | Time |
|-----------|---------------|------|
| Lookup by key | `dict` | O(1) |
| Membership test | `set` | O(1) |
| Ordered unique | `dict` (3.7+) | O(1) |
| Min/Max tracking | `heapq` | O(log n) |
| Range queries | Sorted list + bisect | O(log n) |
| Frequency count | `Counter` | O(1) |
| FIFO queue | `deque` | O(1) |
| LRU cache | `functools.lru_cache` | O(1) |

❌ Forbidden:
```python
# O(n) lookup
if item in list_of_items:
```

✅ Required:
```python
# O(1) lookup
items_set = set(list_of_items)  # One-time O(n)
if item in items_set:  # O(1)
```

