## 🔟 PRECOMPUTATION

### Compute once, use many
❌ Forbidden:
```python
# Recomputes on every call
def get_discount(user_tier: str) -> Decimal:
    tiers = compute_tier_discounts()  # Expensive
    return tiers[user_tier]
```

✅ Required:
```python
# Computed once at module load
TIER_DISCOUNTS: dict[str, Decimal] = {
    "bronze": Decimal("0.05"),
    "silver": Decimal("0.10"),
    "gold": Decimal("0.15"),
}

def get_discount(user_tier: str) -> Decimal:
    return TIER_DISCOUNTS.get(user_tier, Decimal("0"))
```

